WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.355
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:48.745 --> 01:50.585
Lu Le told me

4
01:50.665 --> 01:52.705
that the Bolo Culture project is having some issues.

5
01:53.585 --> 01:54.505
Relax.

6
01:55.705 --> 01:57.225
You just joined not long ago,

7
01:57.305 --> 01:59.145
and things with Lin Long didn't end well.

8
01:59.225 --> 02:01.025
It's inevitable that the project is moving slowly.

9
02:01.665 --> 02:03.025
They approved my proposal.

10
02:05.985 --> 02:07.385
If you lead it personally

11
02:07.465 --> 02:10.225
and bring in Mr. Pi, plus some foreign global partner

12
02:10.304 --> 02:11.705
for show,

13
02:11.785 --> 02:13.385
this project should be good to go.

14
02:21.585 --> 02:22.745
Well done.

15
02:24.345 --> 02:25.945
By the way, have you gotten confirmed yet?

16
02:26.545 --> 02:28.465
-Still a few days to go. -Sit.

17
02:32.745 --> 02:35.145
Congratulations. Your probation period is ending early.

18
02:39.025 --> 02:40.745
Once the contract is signed,

19
02:40.825 --> 02:42.305
you'll be promoted to SBA,

20
02:42.385 --> 02:43.945
Senior Business Analyst.

21
02:46.625 --> 02:47.465
Thank you, Ms. Sha.

22
02:50.985 --> 02:54.025
So, will Ms. Lin still be my mentor?

23
02:54.105 --> 02:57.065
Mentors are only for junior analysts who just joined.

24
02:57.145 --> 02:58.305
You no longer "qualify" for that.

25
02:59.545 --> 03:01.785
You're on my team from now on.

26
03:04.025 --> 03:05.545
I'll do my best not to let you down.

27
03:06.825 --> 03:07.665
CONSULTING PROJECT TEAM CONFIGURATION

28
03:07.745 --> 03:10.225
A typical Maxmise

29
03:10.305 --> 03:13.025
consulting project team has about five people.

30
03:13.105 --> 03:14.865
One partner. Shows up once a week.

31
03:14.945 --> 03:17.585
One project manager. Three consultants.

32
03:17.665 --> 03:19.105
On-site every day.

33
03:19.185 --> 03:21.705
For this Bolo Culture project, I'll be the project manager.

34
03:21.785 --> 03:24.105
Cindy and Du Wen will be the two consultants,

35
03:24.185 --> 03:25.705
plus one business analyst as team members.

36
03:25.785 --> 03:28.705
But because the client specifically requested it,

37
03:28.785 --> 03:32.145
Xu Chi will join as an exception for the SBA role.

38
03:32.225 --> 03:34.985
Now let Xu Chi give everyone an overview of the project.

39
03:35.065 --> 03:35.985
Sure.

40
03:41.145 --> 03:42.705
Xu Chi's killing it.

41
03:42.785 --> 03:45.625
It's only been a few months, and she's already an SBA.

42
03:45.705 --> 03:47.505
She's the first among us, right?

43
03:47.585 --> 03:49.625
Honestly, the one who should feel most embarrassed is Lin Long.

44
03:49.705 --> 03:51.505
She gave Xu Chi such a hard time before.

45
03:51.585 --> 03:55.025
Now Xu Chi has started her own project.

46
03:55.105 --> 03:56.425
She doesn't even report to Lin Long anymore.

47
04:01.745 --> 04:03.145
-Hello, Ms. Lin. -Hello.

48
04:10.425 --> 04:11.865
I'm not giving up.

49
04:11.945 --> 04:13.225
Once this phase is over,

50
04:13.305 --> 04:16.705
I'm taking back everything I've given up.

51
04:27.145 --> 04:29.745
Pregnant women can't drink coffee. Don't you know?

52
04:32.585 --> 04:34.585
I knew something would go wrong the moment I heard.

53
04:34.665 --> 04:36.345
Can't you have held out a little longer?

54
04:36.945 --> 04:38.905
You were doing such a good job playing along

55
04:38.985 --> 04:40.985
with your husband and Sha Sha.

56
04:41.065 --> 04:43.185
You've gotten this far,

57
04:43.265 --> 04:45.185
and now you're going to blow it all?

58
04:46.225 --> 04:47.665
How can I hold out?

59
04:47.745 --> 04:49.905
The Bolo Culture project was mine from the start.

60
04:49.985 --> 04:51.625
But Sha Sha didn't even ask me

61
04:51.705 --> 04:53.425
before putting Cindy and Xu Chi on the team.

62
04:53.505 --> 04:56.265
Anyone but them. Why does it have to be those two?

63
04:57.865 --> 05:00.105
This project will take another three or four months.

64
05:00.185 --> 05:03.385
You can't just go on maternity leave halfway through, can you?

65
05:03.465 --> 05:07.385
Besides, Xu Chi is the one who closed this deal.

66
05:07.465 --> 05:10.465
And Cindy just finished the Sato Pharmaceuticals project.

67
05:10.545 --> 05:12.705
She's on break now and available.

68
05:12.785 --> 05:14.545
If I were Sha Sha, I'd make the same call.

69
05:17.465 --> 05:18.505
Whose side are you on?

70
05:19.545 --> 05:21.425
Don't turn your fire on me.

71
05:22.585 --> 05:25.305
I'm telling you this because I actually care about you.

72
05:25.385 --> 05:28.865
Xu Chi's really come into her own now.

73
05:28.945 --> 05:31.025
All we can do is stay calm, right?

74
05:31.105 --> 05:33.465
There are so many people in the company. Don't let them enjoy the show.

75
05:33.545 --> 05:35.745
Just focus on having your baby safely.

76
05:35.825 --> 05:37.545
Six months later, you'll be back in the game.

77
05:39.065 --> 05:40.585
That's what you say to someone going to the execution ground.

78
05:40.665 --> 05:43.905
You have to hit rock bottom before you can bounce back.

79
05:55.025 --> 05:55.905
Congratulations.

80
05:59.825 --> 06:00.665
It's nothing.

81
06:01.265 --> 06:04.025
All thanks to your guidance.

82
06:16.185 --> 06:18.505
Lin, there's a new infant insurance plan recently.

83
06:18.585 --> 06:20.745
I think it'd be perfect for you. Let me send it over.

84
06:20.825 --> 06:22.305
PENGCHENG WANLI CHILDREN'S OVERSEAS FURTHER-STUDY ENDOWMENT PLAN

85
06:24.385 --> 06:26.545
I'm interested. Run the numbers for me.

86
06:26.625 --> 06:29.305
If I start from birth and aim for college,

87
06:29.385 --> 06:30.305
what's the premium?

88
06:31.185 --> 06:33.545
If you start from birth,

89
06:33.625 --> 06:35.385
I'd recommend a 15-year payment plan.

90
06:35.465 --> 06:36.945
About 120,000 per installment.

91
06:38.065 --> 06:39.465
Hundred and twenty thousand?

92
06:47.505 --> 06:50.465
TRANSFER TO JIANG YONGGE -500,000.00

93
06:51.745 --> 06:53.225
It's been this long.

94
06:53.305 --> 06:55.265
Why didn't you ever tell me?

95
06:55.345 --> 06:57.465
I forgot, okay?

96
06:57.545 --> 06:59.625
It's not a big deal. Do you have to blow up like this?

97
06:59.705 --> 07:01.105
That's 500,000, Jiang Zhiwen.

98
07:01.185 --> 07:02.545
Are you out of your mind?

99
07:03.185 --> 07:04.465
I'm about to give birth any day now.

100
07:04.545 --> 07:05.745
We're about to have another money pit.

101
07:05.825 --> 07:07.345
You didn't even discuss it with me

102
07:07.425 --> 07:09.905
before lending that much money to someone?

103
07:10.705 --> 07:13.385
Someone? They're my parents!

104
07:13.465 --> 07:14.825
Stop making a scene.

105
07:14.905 --> 07:16.585
The postnatal care center is already paid for.

106
07:16.665 --> 07:18.465
How much could diapers and formula possibly cost?

107
07:18.545 --> 07:19.625
The baby's not even born yet,

108
07:19.705 --> 07:20.785
and you're already thinking that far ahead?

109
07:20.865 --> 07:23.185
Why don't you save up for his bride-price too?

110
07:31.825 --> 07:33.065
Legal has finished the review.

111
07:33.145 --> 07:34.905
We accept Maxmise's team and quote.

112
07:34.985 --> 07:36.385
Ready to sign anytime.

113
07:36.465 --> 07:37.305
Done!

114
08:46.665 --> 08:48.265
Look at you all worried now.

115
08:48.345 --> 08:50.305
Where was that energy when you went drinking with others?

116
08:50.385 --> 08:51.465
Jiang Zhiwen!

117
08:52.345 --> 08:53.945
Didn't we agree?

118
08:54.025 --> 08:55.345
This is over and done with!

119
08:55.425 --> 08:56.505
I threw that drink in that scoundrel's face,

120
08:56.585 --> 08:57.825
and you yelled at me in front of your colleagues.

121
08:57.905 --> 08:58.745
I will never get over that!

122
09:12.305 --> 09:14.705
Yes. It's in that Bolo Culture file.

123
09:15.505 --> 09:16.625
Xu Chi?

124
09:16.705 --> 09:18.385
WANGJING SOHO

125
09:18.465 --> 09:19.505
Richard?

126
09:22.145 --> 09:22.985
What's wrong?

127
09:23.745 --> 09:24.585
Are you drunk?

128
09:25.705 --> 09:26.585
A little.

129
09:26.665 --> 09:27.985
Hey,

130
09:28.865 --> 09:32.745
you sent me a WeChat message earlier

131
09:32.825 --> 09:34.945
and then recalled it, right?

132
09:35.025 --> 09:36.105
MESSAGE RECALLED

133
09:37.505 --> 09:38.625
COULD I ASK YOU FOR SOME ADVICE, RICHARD?

134
09:39.185 --> 09:40.025
THAT'S THE SITUATION. I DON'T WANT TO TAKE UP TOO MUCH OF YOUR TIME

135
09:41.745 --> 09:43.625
Why didn't you send it again later?

136
09:44.225 --> 09:45.545
I waited for you for a long time.

137
09:46.665 --> 09:48.385
I…

138
09:49.265 --> 09:50.625
Do you need a tissue?

139
09:51.785 --> 09:52.785
Forget that for now.

140
09:54.265 --> 09:56.425
I can't get a designated driver. Can you drive?

141
09:57.025 --> 09:58.705
-Yes. -Can you take me home?

142
09:59.505 --> 10:00.345
I…

143
10:06.465 --> 10:08.785
The car's navigation system has my home address saved.

144
10:09.385 --> 10:10.225
Okay.

145
10:10.905 --> 10:12.025
Where's your car?

146
10:13.745 --> 10:15.945
-The first black one. -Okay.

147
10:16.025 --> 10:17.745
Steady yourself. I'll be right there.

148
10:17.825 --> 10:18.665
Thanks.

149
10:22.905 --> 10:24.545
Oh my God. This car is way too tall.

150
10:40.425 --> 10:41.665
Easy there.

151
10:42.465 --> 10:43.305
I'm fine.

152
10:44.305 --> 10:47.345
Let me recite it for you. Three point one four one five nine two six

153
10:47.425 --> 10:48.745
-three two three eight four six two… -Stop reciting.

154
10:48.825 --> 10:51.425
Do it in the car. Stop it. Easy.

155
10:52.265 --> 10:54.105
-Thanks. Thank you. -Careful.

156
10:54.185 --> 10:55.785
-Thanks. -Head.

157
11:15.465 --> 11:16.465
Richard.

158
11:17.065 --> 11:18.105
Are you okay, Richard?

159
11:18.705 --> 11:19.945
I'm fine, thanks.

160
11:21.505 --> 11:22.625
You sure?

161
11:23.225 --> 11:24.265
Yeah.

162
11:36.265 --> 11:38.465
-Drop me off here. -Alright, alright.

163
11:38.545 --> 11:40.025
-Message me when you get home. -Easy.

164
11:40.105 --> 11:42.625
-I'll treat you to a meal sometime. -Watch it.

165
11:42.705 --> 11:43.585
You okay?

166
11:48.385 --> 11:49.505
Which finger was it?

167
11:50.345 --> 11:51.385
I just moved in.

168
11:53.345 --> 11:54.905
Do you have a backup password?

169
12:15.105 --> 12:16.825
I'm heading out now.

170
12:18.345 --> 12:19.865
I'll close the door for you.

171
12:26.545 --> 12:27.745
Are you okay?

172
12:29.545 --> 12:31.745
Richard. Are you alright?

173
12:36.745 --> 12:38.385
Don't sleep here.

174
12:38.465 --> 12:40.265
You'll catch a cold.

175
12:40.345 --> 12:41.305
Get up.

176
12:42.465 --> 12:43.665
Easy there.

177
12:43.745 --> 12:44.825
Easy.

178
12:46.385 --> 12:47.225
Careful.

179
12:58.065 --> 12:59.145
Easy there.

180
12:59.785 --> 13:01.265
Wait!

181
13:02.505 --> 13:03.905
Here, here. The bed.

182
13:30.985 --> 13:33.985
TAKE A PICTURE AND SEARCH

183
13:36.585 --> 13:38.185
2023 RAINER LIGHT RED FROM RAINER SAUER ESTATE, 4,988 YUAN

184
16:14.065 --> 16:15.345
-Glad that got sent. -You're awake.

185
16:17.145 --> 16:18.425
What are you doing here?

186
16:19.545 --> 16:21.625
I… I didn't mean to stay.

187
16:23.505 --> 16:24.945
I got an urgent request

188
16:25.025 --> 16:26.825
right as I was about to leave last night.

189
16:26.905 --> 16:29.145
Xu Chi, I'm in London right now.

190
16:29.225 --> 16:31.545
Once you get this email, update the following data

191
16:31.625 --> 16:33.385
in the low-altitude economy report you compiled last time

192
16:33.465 --> 16:35.465
and send it to me immediately. I need it right away.

193
16:42.385 --> 16:44.225
I figured I'd just reply to the email here.

194
16:44.825 --> 16:46.465
Not sure how I fell asleep.

195
16:50.785 --> 16:52.385
-Xu Chi? -Richard?

196
16:52.465 --> 16:53.625
Can you take me home?

197
17:09.424 --> 17:11.065
I'm so sorry.

198
17:11.145 --> 17:13.105
I blacked out last night.

199
17:14.184 --> 17:15.385
I put you through…

200
17:15.985 --> 17:18.145
I'm not some naive little girl.

201
17:18.224 --> 17:20.065
It's just getting drunk.

202
17:20.145 --> 17:22.025
I used to take my ex-boyfriend back to his dorm.

203
17:24.265 --> 17:27.105
Drunk people all act pretty much the same.

204
17:29.865 --> 17:31.065
By the way,

205
17:31.585 --> 17:34.065
there's a bottle of wine broken in your bathroom.

206
17:37.265 --> 17:40.185
You knocked it over yourself. I cleaned it up for you.

207
17:41.505 --> 17:42.665
2023 RAINER LIGHT RED FROM RAINER SAUER ESTATE, 4,988 YUAN

208
17:51.065 --> 17:52.665
No worries. Thanks.

209
17:55.145 --> 17:56.305
What are you laughing at?

210
17:59.665 --> 18:02.705
-Last night… You don't remember? -What did I do last night?

211
18:04.305 --> 18:06.865
"Which…? Which finger was it?

212
18:07.625 --> 18:09.825
This one? This one?

213
18:10.425 --> 18:12.305
I… I just moved in."

214
18:13.385 --> 18:14.225
You okay?

215
18:17.625 --> 18:18.465
Which finger was it?

216
18:19.585 --> 18:20.905
I just moved in.

217
18:20.985 --> 18:23.105
"I… I just moved in."

218
18:25.905 --> 18:26.745
You want some water?

219
18:27.345 --> 18:28.745
No thanks.

220
18:30.385 --> 18:33.745
You seemed more like a real person last night.

221
18:33.825 --> 18:36.945
Usually, you look serious. Thanks.

222
18:37.465 --> 18:39.865
So elite and high-end.

223
18:39.945 --> 18:42.665
I once described you to Bu Tianna.

224
18:42.745 --> 18:46.385
She said you're just a poser.

225
18:47.065 --> 18:48.945
A few days ago, I was your idol.

226
18:49.585 --> 18:51.145
Now I'm your joke.

227
18:51.225 --> 18:52.665
So, learn from my mistake.

228
18:52.745 --> 18:54.905
Even for work, don't drink that much.

229
18:56.345 --> 18:57.625
Such a vibe…

230
18:57.705 --> 19:00.465
Please don't use that word. I'm more like your big brother at best.

231
19:01.065 --> 19:04.385
Fine. Ye. Ye the Legend.

232
19:05.385 --> 19:06.585
I have to go.

233
19:06.665 --> 19:08.865
I have to be at work in two hours.

234
19:08.945 --> 19:10.545
-Let me drive you. -Don't bother.

235
19:10.625 --> 19:11.625
I live really close.

236
19:11.705 --> 19:15.505
Just turn the corner over there. It's a white three-story building.

237
19:16.505 --> 19:17.345
9 Days Inn?

238
19:18.305 --> 19:19.145
Yeah.

239
19:19.825 --> 19:23.265
The room isn't even a tenth the size of yours,

240
19:23.345 --> 19:24.505
but it's the same neighborhood.

241
19:24.585 --> 19:26.225
So I've got the same good taste as you.

242
19:27.545 --> 19:29.585
I need to hurry back and wash my lucky outfit.

243
19:29.665 --> 19:31.745
I finally landed my first deal.

244
19:31.825 --> 19:32.905
Let me wash it for you!

245
19:33.945 --> 19:35.785
I… I didn't mean anything by it.

246
19:35.865 --> 19:38.105
It's a serviced apartment. They have 24-hour room service.

247
19:38.785 --> 19:40.385
They can have it done within an hour.

248
19:40.905 --> 19:42.265
Red wine stains are hard to get out.

249
19:42.865 --> 19:44.545
This is your first deal. It's important to you, right?

250
19:45.905 --> 19:47.385
It's fine. I can wash it myself.

251
19:47.465 --> 19:48.745
We can have breakfast while we wait.

252
19:49.825 --> 19:52.385
Just think of it as my thank-you for driving me home last night.

253
19:54.945 --> 19:55.785
Alright?

254
20:03.665 --> 20:05.305
I've been in Beijing so long,

255
20:05.905 --> 20:07.825
but I've never seen a view like this before.

256
20:07.905 --> 20:10.625
Isn't Maxmise's office building taller than this?

257
20:11.465 --> 20:12.465
It's different.

258
20:13.705 --> 20:14.905
The view may be the same,

259
20:15.705 --> 20:17.625
but the mood you bring to it isn't.

260
20:23.305 --> 20:25.825
You live in a place this big all by yourself.

261
20:26.425 --> 20:28.025
It must be pretty expensive.

262
20:28.945 --> 20:32.025
I don't know. The car and the apartment are both company rentals.

263
20:34.505 --> 20:36.905
Once you make partner and get global pay,

264
20:36.985 --> 20:38.985
Maxmise will offer you the same perk.

265
20:39.545 --> 20:41.305
You know how our industry is.

266
20:41.825 --> 20:43.865
You barely spend a few days at home a month.

267
20:43.945 --> 20:46.305
Home is just a place to store your stuff.

268
20:49.705 --> 20:52.145
I appreciate the comfort

269
20:52.225 --> 20:53.585
and encouragement.

270
20:56.745 --> 20:57.585
Richard,

271
20:58.825 --> 21:02.305
I landed this project with Bolo Culture. But that's just the first step.

272
21:03.065 --> 21:06.745
I will become who you are now. I definitely will.

273
21:06.825 --> 21:07.985
What am I like?

274
21:09.545 --> 21:11.105
I'm not as great as you think.

275
21:11.185 --> 21:14.265
All that glamor and sophistication

276
21:14.345 --> 21:17.145
is just a facade for getting by in this world.

277
21:17.745 --> 21:20.225
You're right. A lot of people buy into it,

278
21:20.305 --> 21:21.905
so it fools some people.

279
21:22.585 --> 21:24.665
But behind the emperor's new clothes,

280
21:24.745 --> 21:26.425
I'm just an ordinary person.

281
21:26.505 --> 21:28.985
I boil water and make instant noodles myself.

282
21:29.065 --> 21:31.345
I have plenty of weak and useless moments too.

283
21:31.425 --> 21:32.945
Like yesterday.

284
21:33.025 --> 21:35.945
I got wasted because I had to entertain a client.

285
21:36.745 --> 21:38.545
You're already a partner.

286
21:38.625 --> 21:40.145
You still have to do that kind of social drinking?

287
21:41.865 --> 21:42.825
Of course.

288
21:43.385 --> 21:46.585
Our whole lives are about trading what we have

289
21:46.665 --> 21:48.025
for what we want,

290
21:48.745 --> 21:51.025
tirelessly, and unremittingly.

291
21:54.545 --> 21:57.105
Outdated inspirational quotes. So cheesy.

292
21:57.705 --> 22:01.465
Anyway, I'm going to buy my mom's old apartment,

293
22:01.545 --> 22:03.265
drink the same fine wine as you,

294
22:03.345 --> 22:05.305
and become a partner just as great as you.

295
22:05.385 --> 22:07.545
And I'll make every client fear me.

296
22:07.625 --> 22:09.505
They won't dare question a single word of my proposals.

297
22:09.585 --> 22:12.145
Good. Then I'll be the first to congratulate you.

298
22:35.065 --> 22:37.145
Zhao Heng says I'm just lucky.

299
22:37.225 --> 22:39.185
That I somehow pull through at every critical moment,

300
22:39.265 --> 22:41.105
and that's how I landed the Bolo Culture project.

301
22:41.185 --> 22:42.385
Don't be too modest.

302
22:42.905 --> 22:45.545
Even a lucky break requires strong foresight.

303
22:46.145 --> 22:49.225
With Bolo Culture, you at least grasped one key point.

304
22:49.305 --> 22:50.585
Sometimes,

305
22:50.665 --> 22:53.465
consulting isn't about plotting grand blueprints for companies.

306
22:53.545 --> 22:55.745
It's about getting paid to be the client's mouthpiece.

307
22:56.945 --> 22:58.585
The client wants something but doesn't want to say it,

308
22:58.665 --> 22:59.865
so we propose it.

309
22:59.945 --> 23:01.865
The client wants to do something but doesn't want to take the blame,

310
23:01.945 --> 23:03.265
so we push it forward.

311
23:03.345 --> 23:04.345
If it works, everyone's happy.

312
23:04.425 --> 23:06.385
If it fails, it's all on us.

313
23:06.465 --> 23:08.265
And the client is always right.

314
23:09.105 --> 23:11.185
When you put it that way,

315
23:11.265 --> 23:12.585
I do seem pretty professional.

316
23:12.665 --> 23:15.065
No wonder Sha Sha promoted me so quickly.

317
23:15.145 --> 23:16.425
She must really see my potential.

318
23:17.745 --> 23:19.145
Don't get cocky just because I praised you.

319
23:24.185 --> 23:25.225
-Bye. -Bye.

320
23:29.825 --> 23:31.025
Morning.

321
23:34.225 --> 23:35.705
Same outfit.

322
23:37.265 --> 23:39.545
I pulled an all-nighter working last night.

323
23:42.505 --> 23:44.345
He's that polished scumbag poser you were talking about?

324
23:45.425 --> 23:48.065
I ran into him while buying breakfast and he gave me a ride.

325
23:48.145 --> 23:50.305
Turns out his building is right across the street,

326
23:50.385 --> 23:52.305
-and our parking garages-- -I didn't ask anything,

327
23:52.385 --> 23:53.545
but you explained all that yourself.

328
23:53.625 --> 23:56.025
Are you feeling guilty, or are you feeling guilty?

329
23:59.505 --> 24:00.945
Why are you so interested in me today?

330
24:01.545 --> 24:04.745
Don't tell me you're jealous I got promoted to SBA before you?

331
24:08.705 --> 24:10.145
Jealous of you?

332
24:10.825 --> 24:12.225
There's a better chance

333
24:12.305 --> 24:14.745
of Zhao Heng getting with me than me being jealous of you.

334
24:15.505 --> 24:17.505
Probably this week, Ande Energy

335
24:17.585 --> 24:20.065
will come in and sign the project cooperation agreement with me.

336
24:20.145 --> 24:21.465
Not a huge deal.

337
24:21.545 --> 24:23.145
Just twice the size of your project.

338
24:23.865 --> 24:25.625
Congratulations. Warmest congratulations.

339
24:25.705 --> 24:27.545
Don't worry. I'll be super jealous of you.

340
24:34.665 --> 24:36.785
Alright. Stop pretending you don't care.

341
24:36.865 --> 24:39.465
Ande Energy's CEO used to work under my dad.

342
24:39.545 --> 24:41.025
Many say

343
24:41.105 --> 24:43.745
even if he makes this project happen, it's nothing but a favor-based deal.

344
24:45.505 --> 24:47.585
Connections are part of the resources.

345
24:47.665 --> 24:50.025
Why else would Maxmise bother with the alumni network

346
24:50.105 --> 24:52.025
and keep former employees happy?

347
24:52.105 --> 24:55.145
Because former employees bring in about half of our business.

348
24:55.865 --> 24:57.545
Sha Sha said even if Su Su quits,

349
24:57.625 --> 24:59.185
she'll get N+6 severance

350
24:59.265 --> 25:00.625
and a personal recommendation letter.

351
25:00.705 --> 25:01.585
And

352
25:02.105 --> 25:03.825
it's not like Ande Energy's money belongs to the CEO personally.

353
25:03.905 --> 25:05.465
If your proposal wasn't good enough,

354
25:05.545 --> 25:07.305
would their internal feasibility analysis pass?

355
25:07.385 --> 25:09.145
Risk assessment? Legal compliance?

356
25:12.145 --> 25:12.985
You had better resources

357
25:13.065 --> 25:14.745
and a broader perspective than me from day one.

358
25:14.825 --> 25:17.265
But I'm not going to dwell on what I can't change.

359
25:17.865 --> 25:19.345
After all, I've got things I'm better at than you.

360
25:19.425 --> 25:21.665
Like rapid analysis and luck.

361
25:22.425 --> 25:24.905
So as long as we're strong enough, our weaknesses won't become flaws.

362
25:26.385 --> 25:28.825
No. Our flaws won't become weaknesses.

363
25:32.305 --> 25:33.385
Who taught you that?

364
25:33.905 --> 25:36.505
Sha Sha or that poser?

365
25:38.785 --> 25:40.825
I figured that out myself from all the times

366
25:40.905 --> 25:42.145
I went up against Lin Long.

367
25:47.785 --> 25:48.785
This one.

368
25:49.465 --> 25:50.465
Yeah, thanks.

369
25:52.425 --> 25:54.505
-Morning. -I'm looking for our packages.

370
25:54.585 --> 25:56.145
Hold on. Let me find them for you.

371
25:58.385 --> 25:59.585
Morning, Ms. Lin.

372
26:05.305 --> 26:07.305
She's wearing yesterday's outfit too, right?

373
26:08.945 --> 26:11.905
Is something going on with her family?

374
26:19.145 --> 26:21.865
-Xu Chi, let's go. -Coming.

375
26:43.305 --> 26:46.025
Don't be upset. We'll strike back later.

376
26:51.785 --> 26:52.905
You blocked me?

377
26:53.785 --> 26:55.145
Why?

378
26:56.745 --> 26:58.105
Anyone with a shred of emotional intelligence

379
26:58.185 --> 26:59.345
wouldn't ask that question.

380
27:18.145 --> 27:19.745
How can I hold out?

381
27:19.825 --> 27:22.105
The Bolo Culture project was mine from the start,

382
27:22.185 --> 27:23.665
but Sha Sha didn't even ask me

383
27:23.745 --> 27:24.985
before putting Cindy and Xu Chi on the team.

384
27:25.865 --> 27:28.425
Anyone but them. Why does it have to be those two?

385
28:11.185 --> 28:12.345
Dear,

386
28:12.425 --> 28:14.305
what project is Richard Ye working on now?

387
28:14.385 --> 28:15.225
LIN LONG, CELINE

388
28:15.305 --> 28:16.345
Tianhe Air.

389
28:17.025 --> 28:19.625
He's helping them transition from a low-cost differentiated service model

390
28:19.705 --> 28:21.145
to a full-service strategy.

391
28:21.225 --> 28:24.625
This kind of transition is gonna take a ten-figure investment, right?

392
28:25.465 --> 28:28.825
Otherwise, why would our boss have directly poached him as a partner?

393
28:38.545 --> 28:42.265
I heard he's been getting close to some girl lately.

394
28:42.345 --> 28:44.665
That gossip doesn't sound right.

395
28:44.745 --> 28:46.345
Isn't his wife a lawyer?

396
28:46.425 --> 28:48.665
Even if a girl wanted to steal him away,

397
28:48.745 --> 28:51.385
she'd need the time and guts for it.

398
28:59.705 --> 29:01.225
You want to blow things up, do you?

399
29:01.305 --> 29:02.265
Let me make this clear.

400
29:02.345 --> 29:05.345
Know what you should do and what you shouldn't.

401
29:05.425 --> 29:06.505
Got it.

402
29:06.585 --> 29:09.425
Why did you speak without my permission just now?

403
29:09.505 --> 29:11.905
You joined Maxmise just to replace me.

404
29:26.025 --> 29:27.425
Yes, it's been signed.

405
29:29.385 --> 29:32.785
Yes, yes. This is all thanks to you, Richard.

406
29:34.345 --> 29:36.865
Okay. Send the documents over by courier then.

407
29:36.945 --> 29:38.425
I'll review them right away.

408
30:07.625 --> 30:08.825
Let's have lunch, Zhao Heng.

409
30:09.385 --> 30:10.345
Okay.

410
30:13.345 --> 30:14.985
Come on, Senior Business Analyst.

411
30:15.905 --> 30:16.905
Time to eat.

412
30:17.425 --> 30:18.625
-Be right there. -Alright.

413
30:58.905 --> 30:59.745
Signee…

414
30:59.825 --> 31:00.665
FIRST COPY-CONFIDENTIAL DOCUMENT ACKNOWLEDGMENT-OF-RECEIPT FORM

415
31:00.745 --> 31:01.745
Ye Xinzhi?

416
31:08.145 --> 31:08.985
Sha Sha!

417
31:10.505 --> 31:11.785
I want to report something.

418
31:12.425 --> 31:15.185
Xu Chi has seriously violated company employee standards

419
31:15.265 --> 31:16.305
and professional ethics.

420
31:16.385 --> 31:18.785
The Bolo Culture project wasn't secured by her alone.

421
31:18.865 --> 31:21.185
It was all C&amp;C Consulting's partner, Ye Xinzhi, helping her.

422
31:22.305 --> 31:23.745
-Ye Xinzhi? -Think about it.

423
31:23.825 --> 31:25.145
How long has she been out of school?

424
31:25.225 --> 31:27.185
How could she have landed such a big deal on her own?

425
31:27.265 --> 31:30.145
And Ye Xinzhi even gave her his projects of C&amp;C Consulting to work on.

426
31:30.745 --> 31:32.665
C&amp;C Consulting. That's our competitor.

427
31:32.745 --> 31:34.025
Lin Long,

428
31:34.105 --> 31:35.985
-those are serious accusations-- -I have proof, Sha Sha.

429
31:36.065 --> 31:39.185
Xu Chi is very likely a corporate spy sent by C&amp;C Consulting.

430
31:39.265 --> 31:41.025
She's here to steal our trade secrets.

431
31:41.705 --> 31:43.385
Step by step, she's been trying to push me out

432
31:43.465 --> 31:44.945
and replace me.

433
31:45.025 --> 31:47.025
This was all planned from the very beginning.

434
31:53.465 --> 31:55.945
Ms. Lin, what are you talking about? I don't understand at all.

435
31:56.865 --> 31:58.745
Still playing dumb even now?

436
31:59.345 --> 32:01.065
Don't tell me you don't know Ye Xinzhi.

437
32:01.145 --> 32:02.585
I do know him.

438
32:03.425 --> 32:04.465
But I met him

439
32:04.545 --> 32:05.985
at the consulting industry summit that you took me to.

440
32:06.625 --> 32:08.305
You even told me to take the chance to network

441
32:08.385 --> 32:09.625
with more people in the industry.

442
32:09.705 --> 32:11.905
Mr. Pi is giving a speech at the summit tomorrow afternoon.

443
32:11.985 --> 32:14.865
I'll bring you along. You can meet some people in the circle.

444
32:14.945 --> 32:16.865
Alright. Thanks, Ms. Lin.

445
32:16.945 --> 32:19.865
Hello, everyone. I'm Ye Xinzhi from C&amp;C Consulting.

446
32:19.945 --> 32:21.585
What are you talking about?

447
32:22.185 --> 32:24.585
I never introduced you two, and I never said any of that.

448
32:24.665 --> 32:26.825
Why are you lying through your teeth like this?

449
32:26.905 --> 32:28.345
Lin Long, calm down.

450
32:29.025 --> 32:30.145
Get to the point.

451
32:30.225 --> 32:31.625
You said you have proof

452
32:31.705 --> 32:33.065
that Xu Chi worked on Ye Xinzhi's C&amp;C Consulting projects.

453
32:33.145 --> 32:34.305
Can you show it?

454
32:38.305 --> 32:39.145
Here it is.

455
32:40.505 --> 32:43.385
Ye Xinzhi just landed the Tianhe Air digital transformation project.

456
32:43.465 --> 32:44.865
It's huge news in the industry.

457
32:44.945 --> 32:47.625
But he handed Tianhe Air' internal confidential documents

458
32:48.225 --> 32:49.105
over to Xu Chi.

459
32:56.345 --> 32:58.265
Xu Chi, how do you explain this?

460
32:59.305 --> 33:01.625
What proof do you have that this came from Ye Xinzhi?

461
33:02.225 --> 33:03.065
Don't you remember?

462
33:04.305 --> 33:08.585
The confidentiality sign-off section has Ye Xinzhi's signature on it.

463
33:11.345 --> 33:13.345
Can I take a look? I don't remember there being a signature on this.

464
33:18.225 --> 33:19.145
See for yourself.

465
33:25.385 --> 33:26.225
CASE FILE

466
33:26.305 --> 33:27.745
There's nothing.

467
33:34.745 --> 33:36.505
SIGNEE

468
33:36.585 --> 33:38.705
RECEIVED BY

469
33:40.505 --> 33:41.425
This is impossible.

470
33:46.425 --> 33:49.945
CONFIDENTIAL DOCUMENT ACKNOWLEDGMENT-OF-RECEIPT FORM

471
33:56.865 --> 33:59.225
Ms. Sha, you know I always like to collect industry information

472
33:59.305 --> 34:00.305
to practice my analytical skills.

473
34:00.385 --> 34:02.345
This month, I chose the aviation industry.

474
34:03.025 --> 34:04.545
The information in this file includes not only

475
34:04.625 --> 34:07.265
Tianhe's publicly-available annual reports over the years,

476
34:07.345 --> 34:09.185
but also compiled analyses from other think tanks.

477
34:09.264 --> 34:11.385
There are other airlines' data in the back too.

478
34:11.465 --> 34:13.025
It's not internal documents at all.

479
34:13.105 --> 34:15.625
And it has nothing to do with confidentiality.

480
34:17.025 --> 34:17.865
I see.

481
34:19.705 --> 34:21.225
This was all your plan.

482
34:22.784 --> 34:24.505
You set me up, didn't you?

483
34:27.585 --> 34:30.425
Ms. Lin, your condition is really concerning.

484
34:35.105 --> 34:36.145
Sha Sha, I have more evidence.

485
34:37.025 --> 34:38.304
Look at these photos.

486
34:38.985 --> 34:40.105
That day…

487
34:41.865 --> 34:44.585
I saw Ye Xinzhi drop her off at work in the morning.

488
34:44.665 --> 34:47.185
She's his mistress. You can scroll further.

489
34:54.225 --> 34:55.185
Lin Long.

490
34:56.385 --> 34:57.785
Ye Xinzhi has been divorced for a long time.

491
34:58.825 --> 35:01.745
He and I were in different class years at Huaou Business School.

492
35:01.825 --> 35:04.305
He admitted it himself at the last alumni gathering.

493
35:08.265 --> 35:09.305
But Xu Chi,

494
35:10.185 --> 35:12.345
while the company doesn't get involved in employees' personal lives,

495
35:12.425 --> 35:13.425
these photos…

496
35:14.265 --> 35:16.185
A senior tripped. I passed by and lent a hand.

497
35:16.265 --> 35:17.345
Am I really being framed for this?

498
35:17.425 --> 35:18.305
We're all women here.

499
35:18.385 --> 35:20.505
You should know how vicious this kind of slander is.

500
35:22.665 --> 35:23.905
And

501
35:23.985 --> 35:25.385
if this photo were taken from a wider angle,

502
35:25.465 --> 35:27.505
you'd see Bu Tianna right there in the elevator lobby.

503
35:28.145 --> 35:30.905
Am I really so brazen that I'd carry on in front of a colleague?

504
35:35.105 --> 35:36.825
Sha Sha, believe me. Don't listen to her.

505
35:36.905 --> 35:39.065
All of this… It's all part of her plan.

506
35:39.745 --> 35:41.545
-She just wants to replace me! -Enough!

507
35:43.025 --> 35:45.785
I've held back because you're pregnant and my senior.

508
35:46.385 --> 35:47.505
How much longer am I supposed to take this?

509
35:48.105 --> 35:51.265
This file was in my drawer.

510
35:51.345 --> 35:52.865
How did it end up with you?

511
35:55.825 --> 35:57.185
Isn't snooping through

512
35:57.265 --> 35:59.985
someone else's drawer theft? Doesn't reading someone else's files

513
36:00.065 --> 36:02.185
violate the company's confidentiality policy? So,

514
36:03.225 --> 36:05.345
I'm requesting the surveillance footage from our work area.

515
36:05.425 --> 36:07.465
Let's get to the bottom of this.

516
36:25.185 --> 36:26.025
Xu Chi.

517
36:27.145 --> 36:28.785
Sometimes,

518
36:28.865 --> 36:31.665
young people can be too rigid. I understand that.

519
36:31.745 --> 36:34.985
But this isn't as serious as you think.

520
36:35.665 --> 36:37.305
-There's no need to escalate it to… -I know.

521
36:38.665 --> 36:42.785
I'm a newbie, so I should lie low and be tolerant.

522
36:42.865 --> 36:45.065
Especially since Ms. Lin is pregnant.

523
36:45.145 --> 36:47.865
For a long time before this, I never told you

524
36:47.945 --> 36:49.105
what she did to me.

525
36:49.785 --> 36:52.065
But please put yourself in my shoes.

526
36:52.145 --> 36:55.865
As my mentor, she never guided me on the Bolo Culture project.

527
36:56.545 --> 36:57.985
Once we get to Bolo Culture,

528
36:58.065 --> 37:00.545
don't say a single word without my permission.

529
37:00.625 --> 37:02.225
-Got it? -Got it.

530
37:02.305 --> 37:03.585
As my supervisor,

531
37:04.185 --> 37:05.825
she tricked me into drinking with an old man.

532
37:08.265 --> 37:09.905
Ms. Lin, I told you I'm allergic to alcohol.

533
37:10.665 --> 37:12.225
So what do we do now?

534
37:13.545 --> 37:14.865
There you go. Right?

535
37:16.665 --> 37:18.025
As my colleague,

536
37:18.105 --> 37:20.985
she slandered my reputation and questioned my integrity.

537
37:21.065 --> 37:21.945
All of that…

538
37:23.905 --> 37:26.185
-isn't serious enough? -Enough!

539
37:27.505 --> 37:29.305
You're setting me up!

540
37:31.425 --> 37:32.265
I…

541
37:38.865 --> 37:41.945
I know Ms. Lin is in a special situation,

542
37:42.025 --> 37:43.425
so this must be hard for you,

543
37:43.505 --> 37:46.185
but let me make my position clear.

544
37:46.265 --> 37:49.105
Whatever you decide to do about this, I'll accept it.

545
37:55.225 --> 37:56.625
You're very good at controlling your emotions.

546
37:57.665 --> 37:59.105
I take back what I said earlier.

547
37:59.185 --> 38:00.825
You're more mature than I thought.

548
38:04.505 --> 38:05.585
‎More mature…

549
38:10.185 --> 38:12.465
-May I go back to work now? -Go ahead.

550
38:13.425 --> 38:14.305
Thanks.
